<view class="page"
  ><load-state
    loading="{{loading}}"
    error="{{error}}"
    bind:retry="retry"
  /><block wx:if="{{item}}"
    ><view class="hero"
      ><view class="eyebrow">{{item.categoryText}} / {{item.assetNo}}</view
      ><view class="title">{{item.name}}</view
      ><view class="subtitle">{{item.labName}}</view></view
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="row"
        ><view class="heading">设备信息</view
        ><text class="tag {{item.status}}">{{item.statusText}}</text></view
      ><text class="label">设备ID / 实验室ID</text
      ><view>{{item.id}} / {{item.labId}}</view><text class="label">型号</text
      ><view>{{item.model || '未填写'}}</view><text class="label">存放位置</text
      ><view>{{item.location}}</view><text class="label">说明</text
      ><view class="value">{{item.description || '暂无说明'}}</view></view
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="heading">预约须知</view
      ><view class="notice"
        >每日08:00—22:00，半小时起约，单次不超过4小时。开始须晚于当前时间且不晚于未来7天，每人最多3条有效预约。申请待审批也占用时段。</view
      ><button
        class="primary"
        bindtap="reserve"
        disabled="{{item.status !== 'AVAILABLE' || loading || !!error}}"
      >
        选择预约时段
      </button></view
    ></block
  ></view
>
